CATEGORIES:Parsha
SUMMARY:Parashat Miketz
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261212
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261213
UID:hebcal-20261212-b3d4a417
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Mikketz (“After”) follows Joseph as he interprets Pharaoh
 ’s dreams and rises to become second-in-command to Pharaoh. When Joseph
 ’s brothers come to Egypt seeking food during a famine\, Joseph accuses 
 them of spying. He insists that they return with their youngest brother\, 
 Benjamin\, and later plants a goblet in Benjamin’s bag.\n\nTorah: Genesi
 s 41:1-44:17\; Numbers 7:54-8:4\nHaftarah: I Kings 7:40-50 | Chanukah Day 
 8 (on Shabbat)\n\nhttps://hebcal.com/s/5787/10?uc=ical-new-york
END:VEVENT
