SUMMARY:Parashat Vayigash
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261219
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261220
UID:hebcal-20261219-b9528bad
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-ALLDAYEVENT:TRUE
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Vayiggash (“He Approached”) opens as Judah pleads with Jos
 eph not to keep Benjamin as a prisoner. Joseph reveals his true identity t
 o his brothers\, crying and kissing them. The brothers bring Jacob from Ca
 naan to Egypt\, and Jacob and his children settle in Goshen. The portion e
 nds as Joseph buys most of Egypt’s land in exchange for food.\n\nTorah: 
 Genesis 44:18-47:27\nHaftarah: Ezekiel 37:15-28\n\nhttps://hebcal.com/s/57
 87/11?uc=ical-new-york
END:VEVENT
